    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d887">

                <pb facs="0802" n="790" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg790"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.248/549: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ankara</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-06-12T20:00:00+03:00">June 12, 1942—8
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 13—1:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>585. I have just learned unofficially that the fourth Liberator, referred to in
                    my 581, June 12, landed about noon today at Diyarbekir.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Cairo.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
